WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
The initial Tatsu juggle ends beside the corner.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.600
Akuma whiffs crouching medium punch while Ryu is down.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.150
Standing medium punch connects as the new wake-up starter.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.100
Crouching medium punch cancels into light Tatsu.

5
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.900
Heavy Tatsu continues the corner juggle.

6
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.650
Ryu lands after the wake-up conversion.
